WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:08.541
Roxy groaned. "We destroyed so many robots.

2
00:00:08.542 --> 00:00:12.116
And now they've all been fixed!

3
00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:16.621
It's like we didn't do anything at all!"

4
00:00:16.622 --> 00:00:18.303
Roxy felt bad.

5
00:00:18.304 --> 00:00:23.379
She wanted to help the Delkorians, but this mission was taking a really long time.

6
00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:27.097
Cozlin held up her hand. Zap!

7
00:00:27.098 --> 00:00:31.632
One robot exploded, and three others fell over, lifeless.

8
00:00:31.633 --> 00:00:38.038
Roxy flew over and grabbed one of the lifeless robots.

9
00:00:38.039 --> 00:00:41.872
She and Cozlin took it into their spaceship.

10
00:00:41.873 --> 00:00:45.694
"Let's get this robot to the bunker," Cozlin said.

11
00:00:45.695 --> 00:00:54.057
"An expert can study its technology and figure out where it came from."

12
00:00:54.058 --> 00:00:56.504
They flew back to the bunker.

13
00:00:56.505 --> 00:01:00.592
But now the grassy hill was covered in large pieces of metal.

14
00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:04.225
Robots were welding the pieces of metal together.

15
00:01:04.226 --> 00:01:07.842
"What are they doing?" Roxy asked.

16
00:01:07.843 --> 00:01:13.852
"I don't know," Cozlin said. "But we can't get into the bunker now."

17
00:01:13.853 --> 00:01:17.072
She turned on her communication device.

18
00:01:17.073 --> 00:01:22.180
"This is Kid Comet. Is everyone okay inside the bunker?"

19
00:01:22.181 --> 00:01:26.142
"Yes," a voice said. "What's going on out there?"

20
00:01:26.143 --> 00:01:32.375
"Robots covered the entrance," Cozlin said. "We can't get in."

21
00:01:32.376 --> 00:01:37.132
"Maybe we can get help in a different city," Roxy said.

22
00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:43.308
"Every city on Delkor has been overrun by robots," the voice said. "No place is safe!"

23
00:01:43.309 --> 00:01:48.619
Cozlin gulped. "Don't worry! We'll stop them."

24
00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:52.709
"She's scared," Roxy thought.

25
00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:56.630
Just then a robot jumped onto the outside of their ship.

26
00:01:56.631 --> 00:02:00.204
It punched into a wing and tried to pull it apart.

27
00:02:00.205 --> 00:02:03.829
"Oh no!" Cozlin shouted.

28
00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:11.581
Roxy flew outside. She knocked the robot off the wing.

29
00:02:11.582 --> 00:02:16.221
Using her heat vision, she quickly welded the wing back together.

30
00:02:16.222 --> 00:02:19.570
Then more robots tried to attack the ship.

31
00:02:19.571 --> 00:02:27.044
Roxy went back inside, and Cozlin flew up into orbit.

32
00:02:27.045 --> 00:02:30.534
"It's not safe down there," Roxy said.

33
00:02:30.535 --> 00:02:35.644
"How will we figure out where the robots came from?"

34
00:02:35.645 --> 00:02:38.614
Cozlin was pressing buttons on the dashboard.

35
00:02:38.615 --> 00:02:42.624
"My aunt Fezlin is a technology researcher.

36
00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:45.533
She lives on Asteroid Number 4.

37
00:02:45.534 --> 00:02:50.092
It's a huge asteroid that orbits Delkor's star.

38
00:02:50.093 --> 00:02:54.352
We can see if she knows anything about the robots."

39
00:02:54.353 --> 00:03:06.773
The power crystal glowed, and the spaceship shot through space.

40
00:03:06.774 --> 00:03:17.325
Minutes later Cozlin's spaceship was docking on Asteroid Number 4.

41
00:03:17.326 --> 00:03:24.393
"I'm even farther from Earth now," Roxy thought.

42
00:03:24.394 --> 00:03:26.828
Aunt Fezlin hugged Cozlin.

43
00:03:26.829 --> 00:03:30.164
"I've been hearing reports about what's happening on Delkor.

44
00:03:30.165 --> 00:03:33.263
I'm glad you're safe, Cozlin."

45
00:03:33.264 --> 00:03:37.864
Cozlin looked at Roxy and shrugged. "That's my real name."

46
00:03:37.865 --> 00:03:41.773
Roxy smiled. "Mine is Roxy."

47
00:03:41.774 --> 00:03:46.414
"It's nice to meet you, Roxy," Aunt Fezlin said.

48
00:03:46.415 --> 00:03:53.595
"Cozlin acts like she never needs help, but everyone needs a teammate sometimes."

49
00:03:53.596 --> 00:04:01.307
Cozlin shrugged. "Roxy isn't a teammate. She's just helping me."

50
00:04:01.308 --> 00:04:04.597
"That's right," Roxy said, pretending to agree.

51
00:04:04.598 --> 00:04:10.997
"Cozlin doesn't even need my help. In fact, maybe I should just go home to my own—"

52
00:04:10.998 --> 00:04:17.205
"Sorry!" Cozlin said quickly. "Please don't go—I do need your help."

53
00:04:17.206 --> 00:04:22.170
Roxy smiled. "I'll stay."

54
00:04:22.171 --> 00:04:26.004
Aunt Fezlin examined the robot, taking it apart.

55
00:04:26.005 --> 00:04:29.106
She looked closely at how it had been built.

56
00:04:29.107 --> 00:04:35.220
"This technology is from the Varda Region," she said finally.

57
00:04:35.221 --> 00:04:39.447
"Then that's where we need to go," Cozlin said.

58
00:04:39.448 --> 00:04:44.663
Roxy had a sinking feeling. "How far away is that?"

59
00:04:44.664 --> 00:04:50.389
Cozlin shrugged. "About a million light-years."

60
00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:59.914
Roxy sighed. "This mission is taking me farther and farther from home!"

